<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#hasDigitalVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Propositional_Object> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#hasDigitalVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The \"hasDigitalVersion\" property represents a relationship between an entity and its digital counterpart, where the digital version is not merely a reproduction but a variation or interpretation of the original entity. This digital version may incorporate additional elements, contextual adjustments, or creative reinterpretations that distinguish it from a straightforward digital copy. The property emphasizes the transformative nature of the digital version, which can offer new perspectives, enhanced features, or alternative forms of engagement with the original entity. The relationship between an entity and its exact digital counterpart is defined as “hasDigitalAnalogous,” while the relationship between an activity and its mere recording is defined as “hasDigitalRecording.”"@en .
