# http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity#process
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity#process> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity#process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Activity> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity#process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Process comprises transformative activities—coherent sequences of actions or operations—carried out by one or more actants, typically exhibiting an internal structure (e.g., phases, tasks, iterations) and an appreciable duration. A process mobilizes resources, techniques, and collaborations toward an intended purpose, producing state changes and potentially generating material or conceptual outcomes."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity#process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "proceso"@es .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity#process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "process"@en .
