# https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E28_Conceptual_Object
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Object> .
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This class comprises purely conceptual and/or intellectual entities without concrete materialization. They constitute results derived from human intellectual and creative activity, with or without the assistance of non-human agencies."@en .
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "conceptual object"@en .
