<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E5_Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This class comprises any occurrence or happening that involves a change or a series of change over time. It encompasses specific and goal-oriented processes, such as creative and productive activities, that result in particular conceptual or material outcomes, and broader, organized and planned endeavors, such as exhibitions or conferences.  They are characterized by their temporal and spatial dimensions."@en .
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E5_Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E5_Event"@en .
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E5_Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "evento"@es .
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E5_Event> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> "https://cidoc-crm.org/html/cidoc_crm_v7.1.2.html#E5"@en .
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E5_Event> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> "https://www.iflastandards.info/fr/frbr/frbroo#F8"@en .
