# https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E6_Destruction
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E6_Destruction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E6_Destruction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E64_End_of_Existence> .
