# https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assement_Assignment
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assement_Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assement_Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Proposition_Assignment> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assement_Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The \"Assessment Assignment\" class represents the act or process of evaluating, appraising, or judging the quality, value, or significance of an entity or work. Assessment Assignments can be applied to artworks, projects, performances, or any other entities that require formal evaluation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assement_Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "asignación de valoración"@es .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assement_Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assessment assignment"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assessment
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assessment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Proposition> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An evaluative proposition expressing a judgment (explicit or implicit) according to criteria or standards, potentially including gradations, comparisons, or attributions of quality/fitness."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assessment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "valoración"@es .
# 
# https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assignment
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/7.1.1/E5_Event> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid197 .
_:genid197 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#allValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Date> .
_:genid197 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#hasTimeSpan> .
_:genid197 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The \"Assignment\" class represents the action of assigning attributes, propositions, statements, evaluations, critical assessment, interpretations, or similar elements to entities. This action involves linking specific descriptive, interpretative or evaluative contents to artworks, exhibitions, cultural creations and events, or any relevant subjects within the domain. The Assignment class is essential for providing additional context, meaning, or evaluation to entities, thereby enhancing understanding, interpretation, and scholarly analysis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "asignación"@es .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assignment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Assignment> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> "https://cidoc-crm.org/html/cidoc_crm_v7.1.2.html#E13" .
