<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Brochure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Information_Object> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Brochure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "brochure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Brochure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "folleto"@es .
