<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Catalog> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#modelingNote> "Modeling guideline: Use Catalogue as Information_Object when it is primarily modeled as documentary support (credits, lists, descriptions, paratexts, references). Add typing as Work_Manifestation when the catalogue is modeled as a publishable/citable manifestation in its own right (edition, circulation, reception, authorship or editorial responsibility, versioning)."@en .
