<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Corporate_Visual_Branding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Visual_Information_Object> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Corporate_Visual_Branding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "para la imagen de marca de las instituciones y corporaciones" .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Corporate_Visual_Branding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "corporate visual branding"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Corporate_Visual_Branding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "identidad visual corporativa"@es .
# 
# https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Creator
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Creator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Creator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Role> .
