_:genid216 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Fair> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The \"Art Fair\" class represents a type of \"Exhibitionary Event\" that brings together multiple galleries, artists, and exhibitors to showcase and sell artworks in a single venue. Art fairs are typically large-scale events that attract collectors, critics, curators, and the general public. These events often include a variety of programs such as exhibitions, talks, panel discussions, and performances, providing a dynamic platform for the art market and fostering cultural exchange."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Fair> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "art fair"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Fair> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "feria de arte"@es .
