<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Foundation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The \"Foundation\" class represents the act of establishing institutions, organizations, groups, or other entities. In the context of art and cultural heritage, this includes the creation of museums, galleries, art collectives, cultural institutions, and similar entities. The foundation process involves legal, administrative, and/or organizational activities necessary to formally create and sustain these entities, ensuring they can operate and achieve their missions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Foundation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "foundation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Foundation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "fundación"@es .
