<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Gallery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An organizational entity dedicated to exhibiting and marketing works of art. Art galleries play a crucial role in the art ecosystem, acting as intermediaries between artists and the public, and often contribute to the development of artistic careers and the fostering of contemporary art trends."@en .
