<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Government_Organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This class represents organizations that are part of the public sector and are responsible for implementing government policies, providing public services, and managing public resources. This class includes entities such as municipalities, ministries, regional governments, and other governmental bodies."@en .
