<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Interpretation_Center> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Cultural_Institution> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Interpretation_Center> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "centro de interpretación"@es .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Interpretation_Center> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "interpretation center"@en .
