<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Narrative_Structure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An ordering structure that organizes an intellectual work through discursive and/or narrative segmentation (e.g., chapters, sections, thematic units) and their relations. It frames how propositions are developed, distributed, or accumulated across the work’s parts."@en .
