# 
# https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Critique_Work_Manifestation
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Critique_Work_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Critique_Work_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Work_Manifestation> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Critique_Work_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "obra crítico-académica"@es .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Critique_Work_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "scholarly-critique work"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Educational_Activity
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Educational_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Educational_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#propositional_activity> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Educational_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The \"Academic-Educational Activity\" class represents activities designed to provide educational or scholarly value to participants. These activities are aimed at enhancing knowledge, fostering learning, and promoting academic inquiry within the context of art exhibitions and cultural events. Academic-Educational Activities include workshops, lectures, seminars, guided tours, educational programs, and other instructional sessions intended for students, educators, researchers, and the general public."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Educational_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "actividad académico-educativa"@es .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Scholarly_Educational_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "scholarly-educational activity"@en .
# 
