<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Work_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Propositional_Object> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Work_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The \"Work Manifestation\" class represents a specific realization or embodiment of an intellectual, literary, cultural or artistic work. This can include physical objects, formal expressions, or digital entities that materialize the work in a specific form, making it accessible to audiences."@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Work_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "manifestación de obra"@es .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Work_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "work manifestation"@en .
