# 
# https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#art_review
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#art_review> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#art_review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Work_Manifestation> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#art_review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In OntoExhibit, an Art Review refers specifically to critical or evaluative texts about artworks and, exhibitions  that are published in mass media, such as newspapers, magazines, journals, or online platforms. These reviews are socio-discursive entities that provide analytical, interpretative, or critical perspectives, often shaping public opinion and influencing the reception of the art or exhibitions they address. This focus allows for the modeling and analysis of the role of art criticism as mediated through public communication channels."@es .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#art_review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "art review"@en .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#art_review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "crítica de arte"@es .
