<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#assingment_critique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Proposition_Assignment> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#assingment_critique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "asignación de crítica"@es .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#assingment_critique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assingment critique"@en .
