<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Foundation_(Institution)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Cultural_Institution> .
<https://w3id.org/OntoExhibit#Foundation_(Institution)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "foundation (institution)"@en .
